<section class="view show" data-backup-pending="<%= data.policy.lastResult==='queued'?'true':'false' %>"><section class="card"><div class="cardHead"><b><i class="fa-brands fa-google-drive" aria-hidden="true"></i> Business data backups</b><span><%= data.policy.branchId?'Your assigned branch':'All tenant branches' %></span></div><div class="cardBody">
 <p>Only the Tenant Owner and Branch Managers can connect Drive, request backups or download their permitted archives. Each archive is a complete encrypted snapshot. Unchanged data does not create duplicate files.</p>
 <div class="stats backupStats"><div class="stat"><div class="k">Google Drive</div><div class="v"><%= data.policy.connectedAt?'Connected':data.googleConfigured?'Ready to connect':'Configuration required' %></div></div><div class="stat"><div class="k">Last result</div><div class="v" data-backup-result-label><%= ({never:'No backup yet',queued:'Queued',complete:'Backup complete',no_changes:'No unbacked data',error:'Needs attention'})[data.policy.lastResult] %></div></div><div class="stat"><div class="k">Last saved</div><div class="v" data-backup-saved><%= data.policy.lastBackupAt?new Date(data.policy.lastBackupAt).toLocaleString():'—' %></div></div><div class="stat"><div class="k">Saved to</div><div class="v" data-backup-target><%= data.policy.lastTarget==='drive'?'Google Drive + platform':data.policy.lastTarget==='fallback'?'Encrypted platform backup':'—' %></div></div></div>
 <% if(!data.enabled){ %><p class="tiny">Backup service is not activated. Configure the private backup worker, dedicated encryption key and persistent backup directory before relying on backups.</p><% } %>
 <% if(data.policy.failureCode){ %><p role="status">Drive or backup service needs attention: <%= data.policy.failureCode.replaceAll('_',' ').toLowerCase() %>. A platform copy is confirmed only when the saved-to status shows it.</p><% } %>
 <div class="rowBtns"><form method="post" action="/tenant/backups/action"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn btnPrimary" type="submit"><i class="fa-brands fa-google-drive" aria-hidden="true"></i> <%= !data.policy.connectedAt&&data.googleConfigured?'Connect Google Drive':'Back up unbacked data' %></button></form><a class="btn" href="/tenant/backups">Refresh status</a><% if(data.policy.connectedAt){ %><form method="post" action="/tenant/backups/disconnect"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn" type="submit">Disconnect Drive</button></form><% } %></div>
 <p class="tiny">Drive archives stay in ClassicFin Hub’s private app folder. If Drive is full, disconnected or unavailable, the worker keeps an encrypted platform copy and retries the Drive copy later. The latest 30 snapshots are retained. These business archives exclude passwords, MFA keys, SMS bodies, tokens and payout PINs. Full disaster recovery uses the separate replica-set backup procedure.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="card"><div class="cardHead"><b>Daily closing backup</b><span>30 minutes after closing</span></div><div class="cardBody"><form method="post" action="/tenant/backups/settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><div class="row2"><label class="field">Closing time<input class="control" type="time" name="closingTime" required value="<%= data.policy.closingTime %>"></label><label class="field">Time zone<input class="control" name="timezone" required maxlength="80" value="<%= data.policy.timezone %>" placeholder="Africa/Juba"></label><label class="field">Automatic backup<select class="control" name="autoEnabled"><option value="true" <%= data.policy.autoEnabled?'selected':'' %>>Enabled</option><option value="false" <%= !data.policy.autoEnabled?'selected':'' %>>Disabled</option></select></label></div><div class="rowBtns"><button class="btn" type="submit">Save backup schedule</button></div></form></div></section>
<section class="card"><div class="cardHead"><b>Recent snapshots</b><span>Encrypted business archives</span></div><div class="cardBody txList"><% if(!data.archives.length){ %><p class="tiny">No confirmed archive yet.</p><% } %><% data.archives.forEach(archive=>{ %><div class="tx"><div class="txMeta"><b><%= new Date(archive.createdAt).toLocaleString() %></b><span><%= archive.recordCount %> records · <%= Math.ceil(archive.size/1024) %> KB · <%= archive.driveFileId?'Drive + platform':'Platform copy' %></span></div><a class="btn" href="/tenant/backups/archives/<%= archive._id %>">Download encrypted archive</a></div><% }) %></div></section></section>
